  "body": "Another small release with some bug fixes\r\n\r\n- Fix for some viewer rendering issues \r\n- New auto fit to width button for viewer\r\n- New annotation shape options like arrow and polyline\r\n- QR code stamp types\r\n\r\n## What's Changed\r\n### Bug Fixes\r\n* fix(i18n): expand Turkish translations by @alkank in https://github.com/Stirling-Tools/Stirling-PDF/pull/8123\r\n* fix(viewer): render non-embedded fonts with matching widths by @reecebrowne in https://github.com/Stirling-Tools/Stirling-PDF/pull/8629\r\n### Enhancements\r\n* feat(viewer): Fit to width and fit to page buttons in the viewer by @EthanHealy01 in https://github.com/Stirling-Tools/Stirling-PDF/pull/8485\r\n* Fix race condition in storybook by @jbrunton96 in https://github.com/Stirling-Tools/Stirling-PDF/pull/8619\r\n* build(deps-dev): bump fast-uri from 3.1.7 to 3.1.9 in /frontend by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/Stirling-Tools/Stirling-PDF/pull/8580\r\n* build(deps-dev): bump ip-address from 10.7.2 to 10.7.4 in /frontend by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/Stirling-Tools/Stirling-PDF/pull/8630\r\n* build(deps): bump dompurify from 3.4.16 to 3.4.17 in /frontend by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/Stirling-Tools/Stirling-PDF/pull/8631\r\n* Shard a11y nightlies by @jbrunton96 in https://github.com/Stirling-Tools/Stirling-PDF/pull/8573\r\n* Fix existing CI errors in Rust by @jbrunton96 in https://github.com/Stirling-Tools/Stirling-PDF/pull/8585\r\n* feat(annotate): add Arrow and Polyline tools by @reecebrowne in https://github.com/Stirling-Tools/Stirling-PDF/pull/8578\r\n* feat(stamp): Add QR code stamp type by @EthanHealy01 in https://github.com/Stirling-Tools/Stirling-PDF/pull/8492\r\n* Bump version to 3.2.2, refresh translations, and backend reliability fixes by @jbrunton96 in https://github.com/Stirling-Tools/Stirling-PDF/pull/8617\r\n### Development Tools\r\n* build(deps): bump astral-sh/setup-uv from 10.2.0 to 10.3.0 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/Stirling-Tools/Stirling-PDF/pull/8594\r\n### Other Changes\r\n* Restructure frontend folder by @jbrunton96 in https://github.com/Stirling-Tools/Stirling-PDF/pull/7062\r\n* build(deps): bump actions/setup-java from 6.0.1 to 6.1.0 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/Stirling-Tools/Stirling-PDF/pull/8597\r\n* build(deps): bump actions/download-artifact from 8.0.1 to 8.0.2 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/Stirling-Tools/Stirling-PDF/pull/8593\r\n* build(deps): bump actions/setup-node from 7.0.0 to 7.1.0 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/Stirling-Tools/Stirling-PDF/pull/8599\r\n* build(deps): bump actions/checkout from 6.0.2 to 7.0.1 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/Stirling-Tools/Stirling-PDF/pull/8373\r\n* Rename frontend path aliases by @jbrunton96 in https://github.com/Stirling-Tools/Stirling-PDF/pull/8616\r\n* Fix waiting-for-author label application by @jbrunton96 in https://github.com/Stirling-Tools/Stirling-PDF/pull/8583\r\n* build(deps): bump github/codeql-action/upload-sarif from 4.38.3 to 4.39.0 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/Stirling-Tools/Stirling-PDF/pull/8638\r\n\r\n## New Contributors\r\n* @alkank made their first contribution in https://github.com/Stirling-Tools/Stirling-PDF/pull/8123\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/Stirling-Tools/Stirling-PDF/compare/v3.2.1...v3.2.2",
